<urn:atm:triage:finding/AI11-QA5-RBQA-F001>
  triage:resolutionGuidance "Fix direction is: remove the UDS (LocalSocketListener) bind/serve path; keep the TCP loopback (local_http_record_path) as the sole Unix local-IPC transport -- NOT the reverse. Platform note: Mac/Linux currently bind both UDS and TCP; Windows is TCP-only (no UDS type exists there at all), further evidence TCP loopback is the intended cross-platform canonical transport. See AI14-QA1-RBQA-F001 for the s14+ instance of this same finding and full guidance." .
